to-be-incorporated-into-paper-123 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-123 = unlines (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: **Declarations.** A data type lists its constructors by fields (`cons (x : A) (xs : List A)`) or by" (cons "type (`cons : A → List A → List A`); a constructor whose type ends in `a ≡ b` is a path" (cons "constructor of a higher inductive type. A definition is a signature and equations; its equations" (cons "may match constructors at any depth, path constructors with their dimensions (`twist (loop i)`)," (cons "and implicit arguments as `{p}`. A codata type lists its fields (`codata Stream A where head : A;" (cons "tail : Stream A`), and a value of it is defined by copatterns: `(smap f s).head = f s.head`." (cons "`record R A = { f : A ; g : B }` is a Σ with named projections, and `R { f = a ; g = b }` (the" (cons "fields by name, in any order), `record { f = a ; g = b }` or `(a , b)` a value of it; `R { r | g = c }`" (cons "is `r` with the fields given replaced; `x.f` projects. `mutual` groups definitions that call each other;" (cons "`postulate x y` declares names without values." nil))))))))))
